  "request": "Draft a service agreement between a freelance bookkeeper and a small business client: scope of services, fees and invoicing, confidentiality, term and termination",
  "title": "Bookkeeping service agreement",
  "description": "Use when a freelance bookkeeper takes on a small business client, to record the services, the fees and the terms both sides agree to.",
